```

Wait — InputOffset returns the offset after the last token decoded. After decoding the top-level value, InputOffset is at the end of that value. Remaining bytes should be whitespace only. That handles `]`, `}`, `{}`, anything. Replace the dec.More() check. Keep the same error message.

Note: go.mod requires Go version? Check go.mod — "需要 Go 1.24". InputOffset exists since 1.14. Fine.

